    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>The plugin provides two options for creating additional content that will be placed on the card and product page.<br />\n1. In Product Meta box that is placed the Label Settings<br />\n2. The plugin creates a separate section in the WooCommerce main menu<br />\nIn it you can create all our label/information elements and set them by bulk<br />\nOur information elements are:<br />\n&#8211; Labels for the product<br />\n&#8211; Additional information elements for the product card</p>\n<h4>The benefits of using Label Builder</h4>\n<p>**The main function of the plugin is to help you customize your product card and page to suit your marketing needs.</p>\n<h4>Key Features</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>**Custom label creating.</li>\n<li>**Using your own label.</li>\n<li>**Creating your own information elements to be placed on the product card.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"https://woo-labels.develux.top/sample-page/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Live Demo</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://develux.com/documentation-for-plugins/label-builder/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Documentation</a></p>\n<h3>General overview</h3>\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/lU2usF0GiNE?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n<h3>Label general settings</h3>\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/P5mtmd5dVS0?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n<h3>Label positioning options</h3>\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/_H137HO5jvw?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n<h3>Product Quantity and SKU</h3>\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/RORmQwhmz1g?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n<h3>Custom label basic settings #1</h3>\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/TnFvBlKNauE?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n<h3>Creating Custom Label #1</h3>\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/sBEfuwn3aJw?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n<h3>Creating Custom Label #2</h3>\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/AtK7JTj_-Hk?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n<h3>How to use your own/ready-made label</h3>\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/TAh3TvzqZFQ?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n<h3>How to set up a tooltip for a label</h3>\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/GI4KW2Jm1P4?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n<h3>How to use Bulk Manager</h3>\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/-Rq_vFaCpeM?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n<h3>Source &amp; Development</h3>\n<p>This plugin ships production-ready, minified assets in the repository’s root dist/ directory (both CSS and JS).</p>\n<p>Source tree:</p>\n<p>src/js/ — JavaScript source files</p>\n<p>src/scss/ — SCSS/CSS source files</p>\n<p>dist/ — compiled/minified assets included with releases</p>\n<p>We encourage contributors to review and build the plugin from source. End users do not need to run any build steps; compiled files are included in releases.</p>\n<h3>Build From Source</h3>\n<p>Requirements: Node.js (LTS or newer) and npm.</p>\n<p>Install dependencies:<br />\nnpm ci</p>\n<p>Development build with watch (creates/update files in dist/):<br />\nnpm run dev</p>\n<p>Production build (minified, outputs to dist/):<br />\nnpm run build</p>\n<p>Build scripts (from package.json):</p>\n<p>&#8220;dev&#8221;: &#8220;webpack &#8211;mode development &#8211;watch&#8221;</p>\n<p>&#8220;build&#8221;: &#8220;webpack &#8211;mode production&#8221;</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Download and install &#8220;Develux Product Label Builder&#8221; plugin using the built-in WordPress plugin installer.<br />\nIf you download Product Card and Page Customizer plugin manually, make sure it is uploaded to <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code><br />\nand activate the plugin through the <code>Plugins</code> menu in WordPress.<br />\nOr follow the steps below:<br />\nPlugins &gt; Add new &gt; Upload plugin &gt; Upload label-builder.zip &gt; Install Now &gt; Activate Plugin.</li>\n</ol>\n<h4>How to enable and use plugin</h4>\n<p><iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"Creating Custom Label #2\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/AtK7JTj_-Hk?list=PLf37IcSF7_crl1B8xxZWmZ5kSF59ardQR\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='where%20can%20i%20get%20support%3F'>\nWhere can I get support?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>A: For support, please email to plugins_support@develux.com or visit our technical documentation page https://develux.com/documentation-for-plugins/label-builder/</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<p><em>Release Date – 02 Sep 2025</em></p>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Install the &quot;Develux Product Label Builder&quot; plugin for your WooCommerce store.",
